[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n4_osric"
text = "# DRAFT
# Osric at dusk, locking the kitchen door (night 4, fog). The abbot's fast: no supper, the refectory locked.
# Jolly as ever. (Tonight his mask comes off in the chase. Nothing here says so.)
# Who could copy a key, and the bakehouse oven: the wrong questions to the wrong brother (Suspicion +5 each).
== start
(Osric is locking the kitchen door, his ring of keys in his fist. He turns round beaming.)
Osric: The porter! You've come for your supper, and there's none. Father Abbot's fast. I've locked my own kitchen.
-> topics

== again
Osric: Still here? There's nothing behind that door but cold pots, porter. I promise you.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n4_osric_fast] How long will the fast last, brother? -> fast
* [if keys_copied] [if not n4_osric_keys] Who in this house could copy a key, brother? -> keys
* [if not n4_osric_oven] When was the bakehouse oven last lit? -> oven

== fast [set n4_osric_fast]
Osric: Not a crumb till it leaves us, Father Abbot says, so it finds nothing in us to feed on.
(He pats his belly and laughs.)
Osric: I've stores enough to last me. It's you I worry for. Skin and bone, and up all night.
-> topics

# The wrong question to the wrong brother (design doc): Suspicion +5.
== keys [set n4_osric_keys] [suspicion 5]
(The keys in his fist go quiet.)
Osric: Copy a key? Whatever for?
Osric: I've forty keys on this ring, porter, and I've never once needed a copy of one.
-> topics

# The wrong question to the wrong brother (design doc): Suspicion +5.
== oven [set n4_osric_oven] [suspicion 5]
Osric: Every morning, for the bread. Not today, with the fast. It's as cold as a grave in there.
(He's still smiling.)
Osric: Why? Were you thinking of climbing in?
-> topics

== leave
Osric: Pray hard, porter! It's all there is tonight!
"
